        "\\Gamma\\!\\left(n+\\tfrac32\\right)=\\frac{2n+1}2\\,\\Gamma\\!\\left(n+\\tfrac12\\right)=\\frac{1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n+1)}{2^{n+1}}\\sqrt\\pi"
